scenario sc over m2
  tally 2
  from 2026-05-01
input sx: num
version scv
  cite s
  governs always
  known 2026-01-01
  sx = 1 "s"
ask d_ref: diff(amt / zero) in sc against m2 law 2026-06-01
ask d_hole: diff(hx[k2]) in sc against m2
ask d_same: diff(zero) in sc against m2
ask d_all: diff(hx[k] / zero for k in ks) in sc against m2
